# Production builds (`pnpm build` / `vite build`) target MAINNET.
# All addresses default from the live mainnet deployment baked into
# src/lib/config.ts (contract/spield/MAINNETCONTRACTADDRESSES.md), so this one
# line is all that's needed. Override individual VITE_* keys here for a re-deploy.
VITE_NETWORK=mainnet

# Cross-chain bridge: a Reown/WalletConnect project id is REQUIRED on mainnet to
# connect EVM/Solana source wallets (get a free one at https://cloud.reown.com).
# Without it the bridge panel still renders, but EVM/Solana sources are disabled
# with a "needs project id" notice. Set it in the deploy environment (e.g. Vercel
# project env vars) or uncomment + fill it here:
# VITE_REOWN_PROJECT_ID=
